{"html":"<div class=\"bondswap-landing\"><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"brand-lockup\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"wordmark\" aria-label=\"Bond Swap home\"><span class=\"brand-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i></span>bond<span>swap</span><span class=\"brand-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✳</span></a><a class=\"powered-by\" href=\"https://bondtrader.io/\">powered by <strong>BondTrader</strong></a></div><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#market-viewer\" id=\"nav-markets\" data-view-markets=\"true\">View markets</a><a href=\"#how-it-works\">Playground</a><a href=\"#bond-basics\">FAQ</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"signin-link\">Sign in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"account-link\">Create account ↗</button></div></header><main><section class=\"market-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"headline\"><div class=\"market-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span> CORPORATE BONDS. ON YOUR TERMS.</p><h1 id=\"headline\">Big bonds.<br><span>Smaller entry.</span></h1><p class=\"market-intro\">Buy and sell fractions of corporate bonds with USDC. Start <span class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">below $1</span> and trade 24/7—even on weekends.</p><p class=\"product-clarification\">Company debt, not company shares.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"primary-action\" href=\"#signup-panel\">Create account <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"text-action\" href=\"#market-viewer\" data-view-markets=\"true\">View markets ↗</a></div><dl class=\"hero-facts\"><div><dt>Funding</dt><dd>USDC</dd></div><div><dt>Trading hours</dt><dd>24/7</dd></div><div><dt>Starting size</dt><dd>Below $1</dd></div></dl><p class=\"hero-risk\">Smaller positions. Same investment risks.</p></div><section class=\"signup-card\" id=\"signup-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"signup-title\"><div class=\"signup-heading\"><h2 id=\"signup-title\">Welcome back.</h2></div><p class=\"signup-intro\">Sign in to your Bondswap account.</p><div class=\"bondswap-signup\"><form class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"relative\"><label for=\"Email\" class=\"mb-2 block text-base font-medium text-auth-field-label\">Email</label><div class=\"relative text-auth-field-icon\"><input data-hotkeys-disabled=\"true\" id=\"Email\" placeholder=\"Enter email\" class=\"h-11 w-full rounded-lg border border-auth-input-border bg-auth-input-bg px-3 ps-11 text-base text-auth-input-text placeholder:text-auth-caption-dim outline-none transition focus:border-auth-link\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\"><span class=\"absolute start-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-80\"><img alt=\"email-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" src=\"/assets/images/auth/email-icon.svg\"></span></div><span class=\"mt-1 block min-h-5 text-xs text-auth-error\">&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"relative\"><label for=\"Password\" class=\"mb-2 block text-base font-medium text-auth-field-label\">Password</label><div class=\"relative text-auth-field-icon\"><input data-hotkeys-disabled=\"true\" id=\"Password\" placeholder=\"Enter password\" class=\"h-11 w-full rounded-lg border border-auth-input-border bg-auth-input-bg px-3 ps-11 pe-11 text-base text-auth-input-text placeholder:text-auth-caption-dim outline-none transition focus:border-auth-link\" type=\"password\" name=\"password\"><span class=\"absolute start-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-80\"><img alt=\"lock-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" src=\"/assets/images/auth/lock-icon.svg\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute inset-y-0 end-4 flex items-center\" aria-label=\"Show password\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 010-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178z\"></path><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"></path></svg></button></div><span class=\"mt-1 block min-h-5 text-xs text-auth-error\">&nbsp;</span></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 py-1 bg-primary/30 text-white border border-primary/40 hover:bg-primary/40 transition-colors h-9 px-4 text-sm rounded !mt-3 !h-11 !w-full !rounded-lg !border !border-auth-button-border !bg-auth-button-bg !text-base !font-medium !normal-case !tracking-normal !text-auth-button-text hover:!bg-auth-button-hover\">Sign in</button></form></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"bondswap-recover-link\">Forgot password?</button><p class=\"bondswap-auth-switch\">New here? <button type=\"button\">Create an account</button></p></section></section><section class=\"playground-section\" id=\"how-it-works\" aria-labelledby=\"playground-title\"><div class=\"playground-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE PLAYGROUND · DEMO ONLY</p><h2 id=\"playground-title\">Try a small allocation.</h2><p>Drop sample USDC onto a corporate bond to see how small allocations add up.</p></div><a href=\"#market-viewer\" data-view-markets=\"true\" class=\"text-action\">View markets ↗</a></div><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Interactive fractionalized bond playground\"><div class=\"visual-top\"><div class=\"view-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose a view\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"artwork-view\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-controls=\"artwork-pane\">Playground</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"market-view\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"market-viewer\">View markets ↗</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"soundless\" id=\"motion-toggle\" aria-label=\"Pause animation\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Ⅱ</button></div><div id=\"artwork-pane\"><div class=\"playground-caption\"><span class=\"chain-tag\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">$</span> USDC</span><span class=\"always-tag\">SAMPLE USDC <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></div><div class=\"playground-ring\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"connector\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</div><div class=\"art-stage\" id=\"art-stage\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"art-object certificate alphabet-card\" data-bond=\"alphabet\" aria-label=\"Alphabet corporate bond. Select a coin, then select this bond.\"><span class=\"ticket-top\"><span class=\"asset-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">a</span><span>CORPORATE<br>BOND</span><span class=\"ticket-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span><span class=\"ticker\">GOOGL</span><span class=\"issuer-name\">Alphabet</span><span class=\"ticket-divider\"></span><span class=\"allocation-line\"><span>Your sample</span><strong data-amount=\"alphabet\">0.00 USDC</strong></span><span class=\"ticket-bottom\">SMALL PIECES. REAL CURIOSITY.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"art-object certificate nvidia-card\" data-bond=\"nvidia\" aria-label=\"NVIDIA corporate bond. Select a coin, then select this bond.\"><span class=\"ticket-top\"><span class=\"asset-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">n</span><span>CORPORATE<br>BOND</span><span class=\"ticket-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span><span class=\"ticker\">NVDA</span><span class=\"issuer-name\">NVIDIA</span><span class=\"ticket-divider\"></span><span class=\"allocation-line\"><span>Your sample</span><strong data-amount=\"nvidia\">0.00 USDC</strong></span><span class=\"ticket-bottom\">A DIFFERENT SLICE OF THE MARKET.</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"art-object demo-coin coin-half\" data-cents=\"50\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Select 0.50 USDC or drag onto a bond\"><span>0.50<small>USDC</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"art-object demo-coin coin-one\" data-cents=\"100\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Select 1.00 USDC or drag onto a bond\"><span>1<small>USDC</small></span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"art-object demo-coin coin-five\" data-cents=\"500\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Select 5.00 USDC or drag onto a bond\"><span>5<small>USDC</small></span></button><span class=\"floating-sticker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">a little<br>goes a long way.</span></div><div class=\"demo-instructions\"><span class=\"instruction-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↖</span><div><h2>Small pieces. Your choice.</h2><p id=\"demo-instruction\">Drag a coin onto a bond, or tap a coin and then a bond.</p><span class=\"demo-note\">Demo only · no real money or orders.</span></div></div><div class=\"sample-basket\" id=\"sample-basket\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"basket-heading\"><strong>Your little basket</strong><button type=\"button\" id=\"reset-demo\">Reset ↺</button></div><dl><div><dt>Alphabet</dt><dd data-amount=\"alphabet\">0.00 USDC</dd></div><div><dt>NVIDIA</dt><dd data-amount=\"nvidia\">0.00 USDC</dd></div><div class=\"basket-total\"><dt>Sample total</dt><dd id=\"sample-total\">0.00 USDC</dd></div></dl><small>Demo allocation only. No real trade.</small></div><button type=\"button\" id=\"reset-positions\" class=\"reset-artwork\">Reset the playground ↺</button><p id=\"demo-status\" class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></div><div id=\"market-viewer\" class=\"viewer-placeholder\" hidden=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><h2>Market viewer</h2><p>A little space for the bigger picture.</p></div></section></section></main><section class=\"bond-basics\" id=\"bond-basics\" aria-labelledby=\"basics-title\"><div class=\"basics-intro\"><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span> THE SHORT VERSION</p><h2 id=\"basics-title\">Bond curious?<br><span>Start here.</span></h2><p>You know the companies. This is a different way to trade them: their debt, rather than their shares.</p><a href=\"#signup-panel\" class=\"basics-cta\">Create account <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><details name=\"bond-faq\" open=\"\"><summary>What are fractionalized bonds?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><p>A corporate bond is money a company borrows from investors. Fractionalized bonds divide that debt into smaller, tradeable token units. Your rights depend on the product terms.</p></div></details><details name=\"bond-faq\"><summary>Does 24/7 include weekends?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><p>Yes, including weekends. Around-the-clock access does not guarantee that an order will fill at your chosen price.</p></div></details><details name=\"bond-faq\"><summary>What do I need, and how small can I start?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><p>Fund with USDC and start below $1. Consider any applicable funding, network and trading costs separately from your position size.</p></div></details><details name=\"bond-faq\"><summary>Do bonds pay interest?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><p>A coupon is a bond’s stated interest payment. Eligible holdings receive a proportional share on the issuer’s schedule, subject to the product terms and the issuer meeting its obligations.</p></div></details><details name=\"bond-faq\"><summary>Can I go long, go short, or lend?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><p>You can go long (take a view that prices will rise) or short (take a view that they will fall), with optional leverage to increase exposure. You can also lend supported assets under separate terms. Lending differs from receiving a bond’s coupon.</p></div></details><details name=\"bond-faq\"><summary>What should I know about the risks?<span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><p>Prices can fall, issuers can default and you can lose money. Leverage magnifies losses and adds borrowing costs and liquidation risk—the risk of your position being closed. Lending also carries risk; returns are not guaranteed.</p></div></details></div></section><footer><span class=\"footer-line\">Corporate bonds. Crypto-sized starting points.</span><span class=\"risk-note\">Prices can fall. Issuers can default. Trading carries risk.</span><a href=\"https://bondtrader.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Powered by BondTrader ↗</a></footer></div>"}